  "title": "GoHealth to Present at Medicarians 2024: The Home of Senior Health, Wealth, and AgeTech",
  "summary": "CHICAGO, March 28, 2024 /Globe Newswire/ — GoHealth, Inc. (GoHealth) (NASDAQ: GOCO), a leading health insurance marketplace and Medicare-focused digital health company, announced the company will present at Medicarians 2024: The Home of Senior Health, Wealth, and AgeTech on Wednesday, April 10, 2024 in Las Vegas, Nevada. Chief Executive Officer, Vijay Kotte, will speak on the Plenary mainstage at […]",
